Today is Sunday.
I want to buy a German sweet.
It is for the video call.
I take my backpack.
Then I put on my jacket.
I go out of the flat.
It is January.
The air outside is very cold.
The street is very quiet today.
The shops and supermarkets are closed.
A Sunday is a rest day here.
Who is open today?
A Späti is always open.
A Späti is a small kiosk in Berlin.
My Späti is right around the corner.
I walk down the street.
There is the Späti.
I see the light and go inside.
